  "solution": "**Given:**\n\n8 : 4 :: 3.2 : x\n\n**Calculation:**\n\n8 : 4 :: 3.2 : x can be written as (8)/(4) = (3.2)/(x)\n\n⇒ (8)/(4) = (3.2)/(x)\n\n⇒ 2 = (3.2)/(x)\n\n⇒ x = (3.2)/(2)\n\n⇒ x = 1.6\n\n**The value of x is 1.6.**",
